# ===========================================================================
# AgentRT 管理仓 .gitignore
# 策略：非必要不追踪。各叶子仓自行维护 .gitignore
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 默认忽略所有
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 管理仓必要文件（白名单）
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!.clang-format
!.clang-format-ignore
!.gitignore
!.gitmodules
!.gitattributes
!.github/
!.github/**
!ACKNOWLEDGMENTS.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!CMakeLists.txt
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!Doxyfile
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!README.md
!README_zh.md
!SECURITY.md
!SUPPORT.md
!tests/
!tests/CMakeLists.txt
!tests/test_banned_functions.c
!tests/test_smoke.c
!tests/test_string_utils.c
!tests/test_utils.c
!tests/e2e/
!tests/e2e/**
!LICENSES/
!LICENSES/**
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 管理仓必要工具（CMake/README/CHANGELOG 正式引用，须入库）：
# - tools/codegen: syscall.xml SSoT codegen 生成器（CMake 构建与 CI 防漂移校验依赖）
# - tools/airy_cli: 交互式产品 CLI（BUILD_CLI 默认 ON，产品层交互策略）
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!tools/
!tools/codegen/
!tools/codegen/**
!tools/airy_cli/
!tools/airy_cli/**
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 管理仓直属设施（v0.1.2 起自伞仓迁入，IRON-9 [IND] 独立层，随仓入库）：
# - cmake/: 构建系统模块（compilerflags/platform/dependencies/sanitizers/utils 等）
# - scripts/: 官方安装器 install.sh/install.ps1
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!cmake/
!cmake/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
